   - Check data integrity
2. Test in staging:
   - Clone production data to staging
   - Run full migration
   - Verify all functionality
3. Production migration:
   - Schedule maintenance window
   - Take database backup
   - Run migration
   - Verify critical functionality
   - Monitor for issues

